<title>AUSTRIA: WIFO raises Austria 1997 GDP growth forecast.</title>
<headline>WIFO raises Austria 1997 GDP growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian economic research institute WIFO slightly raised its growth forecast for the Austrian economy for this year and next.</p>
<p>It released the following figures ahead of a news conference on Thursday.</p>
